o'::text\)\r\n               ->  Index Scan using pagos_reservaid_idx on pagos p2  \(cost=0.56..5.37 rows=1 width=4\)\r\n                     Index Cond: \(reservaid_reservas = r.reservaid\)\r\n                     Filter: \(cantidad > '150'::numeric\)\r\n\(32 rows\))>>
